Text_en:
The amnesty of 115 political prisoners is a positive step towards reforming the judicial approach of the country.

This action of the judiciary can be the basis for a sustainable change in the way of dealing with political critics, provided that the amnesty criteria are implemented transparently, fairly and without bias.
@alimojtahedzad3

@ejei_org

@EtemadDaily

Considering that no domestic media and no journalists living in Iran have the desire to reflect the situation of #Amirhossein_Mousavi's case despite the broadcast of his forced confession by the 20:30 news section, I published a note on my website in response to this action of the bailiffs before the court session was held;
rezashafakhah.com/2025/10/09/%d9
…

Advocacy for human rights is not just accepting the defense of political prisoners;
The basic human rights include the right to have an identity and having identity documents is the most important thing that can be realized with the presence of honorable lawyers like Parto Burhanpour.
Dear Partojan, God bless you and congratulations on getting the birth certificates of the families of the applicants. 
@PartoBorhanpour
